{"version":1,"content":"<p>聯想似乎正在為Legion Go掌機系列增加一款更加親民的產品。近日，Windows Latest曝光了多張疑似聯想新款掌上遊戲設備的高清圖片，顯示這款產品可能命名為Legion Go Beam。與現有的Legion Go S相比，新機在操控配置、接口數量和屏幕設計上均有所簡化，明顯帶有降低製造成本的意圖。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587014.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:54:53.081479+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:39:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:11.702300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:11.702300+00:00","content_hash":"77dce6841efda3e3f4559e62feb2d61b745292a174020e90068ba33bbea9d297","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}